we build a queue by stack earlier (need two stack)
now we want to build a stack by queue (need two queue)

we use the queue we created in section_5.exercise_2
that was a array based queue.

the idea is we have two separate queue,
when we want to find recent item
we will transfer the full queue to empty queue (so the full queue will be empty)
and the new queue will be exactly same as the previous queue
through this transportation, we can find the top value!

add           O(1)
pop           O(2n) = O(n)
peek          O(2n) = O(n)
isEmpty       O(1)

